<p>Test parameters are from <a href="https://keystonecompliance.com/ipx5-ipx6-water-jets/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Keystone Compliance (IPX5/IPX6)</a> and <a href="https://keystonecompliance.com/ip69k-ingress-protection-testing/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Keystone Compliance (IP69K)</a>. No USDA rule mandates a specific IP rating. Plants specify IP69K where sanitation crews use high-pressure hot water. Learn more in our <a href="/conveyor-types/washdown-conveyors/">washdown conveyors guide</a> and <a href="/industries/food-conveyors/sanitary/">sanitary conveyor guide</a>.</p>
